From: liken <https://liken.sh>
Subject: [PATCH] meson: build libopeniscsiusr as default_library asks

shared_library() builds a shared object whatever default_library
names, so a toolchain that links static only cannot build iscsid and
iscsiadm, which link the library. library() builds the kind that
default_library names and keeps the shared build the default.

Upstream: not submitted

--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -142,8 +142,8 @@
 # install our static man page(s)
 install_man(libiscsi_usr_docs)

-# build the shared library
-libiscsi_usr = shared_library('openiscsiusr',
+# build the library, shared or static as default_library asks
+libiscsi_usr = library('openiscsiusr',
   libiscsi_usr_srcs,
   include_directories: [libiscsi_usr_private_includes, libiscsi_usr_public_includes],
   dependencies: kmod_dep,
